OL,5,G0005 Taggart
OL,6,     FThe team investigate after a
OL,7,     Fpre-wedding parachute jump ends
OL,8,     Fwith the groom plunging to his
OL,9,     Fdeath. As Reid's wedding day
OL,10,     Fapproaches, Ross warns she may be
OL,11,     Frushing into marriage.
OL,12,G0210 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FThe women feed on Kay's mental
OL,14,     Finstability, continuing to torment
OL,15,     Fher. Doreen admits to Kevin and
OL,16,     Fthe police what happened with her
OL,17,     Frape.
